1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,320
Guess what, you dick?

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,780
I just got off the phone with Vernon PD.

3
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:07,160
Oh, no, no, Your uncle's neighbors saw you go into the cabin the night of the murder.

4
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:08,540
They ID'd your photo.

5
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:09,980
I've got you dead to rights.

6
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:11,380
Interesting.

7
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:16,320
But, my uncle only has one neighbor, and I'm pretty sure he didn't identify me.

8
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:16,880
Oh, really?

9
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,300
Because you were so careful?

10
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:20,060
Because he's been dead three years.

11
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,020
Well.

12
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:24,120
I don't know.

13
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,440
I'm friends with Steph Curry.

14
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:27,520
So.

15
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,940
So, this is how it looks to me.

16
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:35,900
You were lying in an attempt to frame my client.

17
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:36,840
No, no, no, Look.

18
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:38,540
Even if we were lying about having a witness.

19
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,120
Which you are.

20
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:39,920
The neighbor's dead.

21
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:42,900
No, it could've been a squatter or a hunter or a squatting hunter,

22
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:43,940
not all hunters have homes.

23
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,840
Peralta's point is, legally, he can say whatever the hell he wants in an interrogation.

24
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:47,300
True.

25
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:49,460
But that doesn't play so well with juries.

26
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:52,060
You screwed up, and my client's leaving.

27
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:52,440
No!

28
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:54,570
He can't leave until I dismiss him.

29
00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:57,840
You've had him for ten hours and 45 minutes.

30
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,100
15 more and we file a harassment claim.

31
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:00,360
Great!

32
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:02,080
Then I'll just keep him for 14 minutes.

33
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:02,520
Seriously?

34
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,220
Just to be childish?

35
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:05,060
Yuh doy!

36
00:01:05,620 --> 00:01:07,260
I told you not to lie!

37
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:08,560
What were you thinking?

38
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:09,960
I thought it would work.

39
00:01:10,740 --> 00:01:12,200
And I wanted to be the one that got him.

40
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,020
this is about your ego?

41
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:15,730
Are you that desperate for everyone to know how great you are?

42
00:01:15,740 --> 00:01:16,820
It's not about everyone.

43
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:17,440
Okay?

44
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:18,080
It's just.

45
00:01:19,180 --> 00:01:20,440
I wanted you to know.

46
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:25,260
Oh, my God.

47
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:30,600
I got it!
